2. AI Progressive Coding Agent ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
Instead your IDE becomes a mentor.
Example: User -> Build Todo App
Agent: Step 1 Create a Todo model. Need a hint? (Yes/No)
Hint: A todo should contain Title, Completed, CreatedAt
User writes. Agent checks. Great! Now create CRUD endpoints.
If stuck, Hint 2: Look at Express Router. router.post(...)
Still stuck: Would you like partial code? Just router.post(...)
This is progressive disclosure. Very few IDEs do this well.
Levels: Beginner (Maximum hints), Intermediate (Only conceptual hints), Expert (No hints).

